  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pakistan Telecommunication Company Limited</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Debt</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PTCL is a leading digital infrastructure company in Pakistan controlled by global telecom major E&amp;. The transaction is a USD 50m commitment from BII to support its planned acquisition of Telenor Pakistan (&#x201C;Telenor&#x201D;), the 2nd largest Mobile Network Operator (&#x201C;MNO&#x201D;) in Pakistan, and a wholly owned subsidiary of the Norwegian Telenor Group. BII&#x2019;s commitment is part of a USD 400 million facility in collaboration with IFC.</narrative>
  </description>
